     <p style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不忘初心担使命</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">传承博雅谱新篇</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奋力开创</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高水平</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">发展</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新局面</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 18pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 18pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">——在主题教育总结大会上的讲话</span></p><h1 style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1月1</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">午</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">点，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">行政楼会议室四</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></h1><p style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委书记、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">长</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">琛</span></p><h1 style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 18pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 18pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>        </strong></span><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 18pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">        </span></h1><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志们：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据中央和省委、市委</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、市教育局党委</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的统一部署，今天我们召开</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育总结大会，主要任务是：认真学习贯彻习近平总书记在中央“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育总结大会上的重要讲话精神，贯彻落实全省、全市</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以及市直教育系统</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题教育总结大会</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各项部署，回顾总结</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题教育开展情况，巩固提升主题教育成果，动员</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党员干部，以永远在路上的精神</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">把初心守成恒心</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">把使命担出力量，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不断书绍兴</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中高水平发展新</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">篇章。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育局党</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">委第一巡回指导组对这次会议高度重视，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">指导组</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组长</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、市教育局党委书记、局长姚国海同志</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">指导组副组长钱金星同志，以及</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">指导组</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">解明远</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志到会指导，等会</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">儿姚局长</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">还要作重要讲话，让我们以热烈的掌声欢迎指导组各位领导的到来。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志们，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1月8日</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中央召开主题教育总结大会，习近平总书记发表了重要讲话，从新时代党和国家事业发展的全局和战略高度，充分肯定了主题教育取得的六个方面重大成果和六条经验，对巩固拓展主题教育成果、不断深化党的自我革命、持续推动全党不忘初心</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、牢记</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">使命作出了全面部署，提出了“六个必须”的明确要求。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1月9日</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上午，省委召开主题教育总结大会，学习贯彻习近平总书记关于不忘初心、牢记使命的重要论述，对进一步把握新时代全面从严治党的基本规律、总结好运用好巩固好主题教育成果、推动守初心不停步再出发提出了明确要求。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1月9日</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下午，市委召开主题教育总结大会，市委书记马卫光强调，认真学习贯彻习近平总书记在“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育总结大会上的重要讲话精神，贯彻落实全省主题教育总结大会部署，把主题教育成果总结好、巩固好、提升好、运用好，秉持翻篇归零、再谱新篇的信心和决心，砥砺初心不停步，践行使命再出发，担当作为走在前，持续推动“不忘初心、牢记使命”扎根铸魂、常抓常新。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1月10日上午，市教育局党委召开市直教育系统主题教育总结大会，姚国海书记强调</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们要认真学习领会</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中央和省、市各级大会精神</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">并</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">结合实际抓好转化和贯彻落实，真正把初心和使命刻在心里、铸牢在思想深处，不断推进自我革命，发扬斗争精神，勇于担当作为，以实际行动干出党和人民满意的业绩，努力把绍兴教育事业发展推向新的高度。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志们，今天会议的议程有两项，一是请市</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育局党</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">委第一巡回指导组</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚国海</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组长作重要讲话，二是由我作工作总结。下面，请</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚局长</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">讲话，大家欢迎！</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">…………</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志们，刚才，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚局长</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对我们</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中“</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不忘初心、牢记使命</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题教育作了高</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">度</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">评价，我们深受鼓舞，同时也倍感压力。对</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚局长</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">讲话中</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">点到的问题、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提出的要求，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委将会严格对照，逐一落实。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志们，我校自</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">去年</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">8月份先期启动第二批“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以来</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，严格按照市教育局党委部署要求，坚决贯彻“守初心</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">担使命</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">找差距</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">抓落实”总体要求，深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，深入学习践行党的十九大、十九届二</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四中全会和教育大会精神，认真把“学习教育、调查研究、检视问题、整改落实”贯穿主题教育全过程，在校党委、基层党支部、全体党员个体三个层面扎实开展各级各类专项行动，做到规定动作不走样、自选动作创特色，实现了“理论学习有收获，思想政治受洗礼，干事创业敢担当，为民服务解难题，清正廉洁作表率”具体目标，取得了丰硕成果，在市委两次督查中受到充分肯定。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">12月10日</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市委马卫光书记亲到校宣讲十九届四中全会精神，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9、10月间</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市检察院翁跃强检察长、市教育局党委姚国海书记先后来校作法治教育和专题党课，都充分体现了上级领导对我校的重视和厚爱。回顾四个多月的主题教育，我们着力“十抓”推进工作：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一抓组织领导，保障方案实施责任落实。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校党政班子把主体责任扛在肩上，认真研究，以身作则扎实推动，切实增强“四个意识”、坚定“四个自信”、做到“两个维护”，从组织体系上保障主题教育顺利推进、抓出成效。</span></p><p style="font-family: 华文仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二抓领学先学，锤炼党组织书记引领能力。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委班子带头上党课，并探索实施“支部书记集体备党课工作坊”，先后开展党组织书记上党课16次，保障主题教育学习不走样、领学有深度。举行“应知应会”学习竞赛7次，表彰先进个人</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">18人次；</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组织“学习强国”月赛2次，表彰学习先进支部</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4个，先进个人85人次，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">浓厚了学习氛围，激发了组织活力。</span></p><p style="font-family: 华文仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三抓基层基础，强化支部战斗堡垒作用。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">从严制定《绍兴市第一中学党支部考核细则（修订稿）》，重新拟定《绍兴一中基层党支部书记岗位职责》，着眼“双带头”提升支部书记党建业务工作水平，组织6人参加“市直学校支部书记培训会”，开展校级“支部书记培训会”5次。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四抓先锋带头，推进党员教师先锋表率作用。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">出台《关于进一步加强新时代党员教师管理的若干规定（试行）》，从政治纪律、理想信念、师德锤炼、业务能力、实践锻炼、廉洁纪律等方面提出学校党员教师先锋作用要求，组织党员教师常规开展“六个一百”活动，带头示范引领。</span></p><p style="font-family: 华文仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五抓主题党日，针对性地开展特色活动。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过主题党日活动，结合本地资源、乡贤校史文化，把主题学习搞生动。9月底，组织参观市档案馆主题教育档案文献展和党性教育史料陈列展；11月初，组织参观马寅初故居，并赴嵊州寻访一中抗战流亡办学旧址，缅怀校史先贤，重温教育初心</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">六抓问题检视，多渠道征集意见重落实。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在教育局层面交流超50人</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">/</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">次，获得各种问题线索23条。在学生家长层面家访600多户，与部分尖子生家长当面交流52人</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">/</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">次，召开学生座谈会交流近150人</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">/</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">次，获得意见建议17条。在校内教师层面，组织各级各类座谈会18个，开展谈心谈话160多人</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">/</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">次，梳理对班子的意见建议53条、对班子成员个人的意见建议100多条。在初中学校层面，走访初中1</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">所，邀请18所初中领导、教师走进一中，获得建议信息9条。立足调查调研，班子成员形成高质量调研报告；所检视的问题，按照即期问题、中期问题、长期问题分类梳理，把立说立改与长期整改结合，逐条对照落实。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">七抓业务融合，围绕中心工作志愿服务。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">针对各年级重大考试，开展党员家访行动，结对学生开展助力尖子、提分中段、帮扶后进的学科辅导和心理疏导，党员教师结对学生定期谈心谈话，自修课主动进班辅导，截止1</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月累计开展志愿服务活动3</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7人/次，办理实事好事</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">33</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5件。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">八抓教师培养，建好教学管理人才梯队。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">立足校本培训，着眼教师能力发展和职业规划，组织85后教师座谈会5次、班主任论坛7次、各类课题组研讨6次。在广泛征求意见的基础上，确定首期学校后备干部储备与培养人选</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，加强干部梯队建设</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">九抓教学提质，精准施策破解复杂难题。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">落实学生个性化分析规划，制定学生整体情况分析报告，合力培优学生综合发展。优化课程设计，编制竞赛生、创新班、普通班等各类课程计划。引领课程开发，启动集体教育和个性化教育需要的必修与选修课程顶层设计工作。管理促进课堂提效，组织全员听课，组织作业布置批改情况督查，提升学生作业效益。班子成员本学期人均听课</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5节，组织参与各年级组、学科组教研活动、成绩分析会议16次。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">十抓服务保障，精心调研实施暖心工程。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">听取群众意见建议，启动教职工社团建设，改善教工餐厅饭菜质量，改善体育馆内教师办公条件，系统改造水路管道系统，解决教工宿舍铁锈水难题。优质建成南校门、风雨走廊、校园绿化等工程，贴心改造体育场、宿舍楼便捷设施，创设优美、雅致校园环境。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在市</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育局党</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">委的坚强领导和指导组的有力督导下，通过全</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">广大党员</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的共同努力，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题教育</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">取得了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">明显</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成效</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">逐步激发</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">广大教师的积极性和创造性，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">初步形成</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了全体教职工精诚团结、励精图治、同甘共苦、锐意进取的管理新局面。</span></p><h1 style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一是提升了理论修养。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">切实加深</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想的理解，进一步领会</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">习近平总书记在全国教育大会中系统总结的推进我国教育改革发展的“九个坚持”的伟大意义，进一步领会市委、市政府对绍兴教育优质发展的决策思路，进一步领会了市教育局对于一中发展的厚望与期待，为如何办好一中教育提供了思想指导。</span></h1><h1 style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二是提高了政治觉悟。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">进一步明悟了学校党员干部的初心与使命，激发了班子成员和广大中层、党员教师坚守一线、立足本职、建功新时代</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作干劲与教育热忱。作为教育人，进一步明晰了教育现代化的含义和实质，更加明确了“为谁培养人”方向、“培养什么样的人”目标和“怎么培养人”方式方法。</span></h1><h1 style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三是增强了担当精神。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委在学习调研、座谈走访、听课交流</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">行动中，进一步摸清一中实际，提出一中方案，着重检视</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育教学工作的薄弱环节，全力破解学校教育发展的瓶颈难题，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">彰</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">显一中特色。有针对性地制定了涉及五个方面25项工作的《2019学年绍兴一中工作要点》，同时将25项工作中50个点的具体任务通过《绍兴一中2019学年重点工作任务清单》，明确时间表，细化路线图，分解落实，责任到人。</span></h1><h1 style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四是排解了群众难题。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦关键任务，紧扣核心要点，深入教师办公室、学生教室、学生家庭，调查研究、破解难题，为下好绍兴一中高水平发展先手棋，从不同角度、不同分管领域调研形成了多篇较高水平的调研报告。举凡困扰教工宿舍铁锈水</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">难</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">题、体育场馆条件改善问题、校园工地及绿化问题、师生食堂饭菜质量问题，都得到了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">较</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">满意的解决。</span></h1><h1 style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五是把住了廉政关口。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">针对学校预算、收支、采购、资产管理、建设、合同、安全等七大高风险内容建立流程等规范</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">制度体系</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经费报销，完善</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校内管控政策制度。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委班子和广大中层</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">切实增强</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">纪律意识，时刻把党的政治规矩挺在前面，筑牢拒腐防线，自觉运用法治思维</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">法治方式处理问题、化解矛盾、维护稳定，时刻保持清正廉洁政治本色。</span></h1><h1 style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在主题教育开展过程中，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚局</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">长和指导组全体成员</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对我们</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委班子进行悉心指导、全程把关、真心帮助，为</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题教育健康有序开展提供了有力指导</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">给予我们很多宝贵意见。特别是</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚局长</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，既抓大事实现引导，也重小事精准指导，展现了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">敏锐的管理眼光和高超的治理技巧</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为一中发展</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">付出了</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大量</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">心血和精力。所以，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中主题教育</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">取得的成效，离不开</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">局党委</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题教育领导小组的正确领导，离不开</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">广大党员教师的倾心投入，更离不开巡回指导组的悉心指导。让我们以热烈的掌声，向市</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育局党</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">委第一巡回指导组全体同志表示衷心的感谢！</span></h1><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在充分肯定成绩的同时，也要清醒的认识到存在的问题，从党的意识和党员意识、担当作为、服务群众、遵守纪律、作用发挥等方面</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深入细察</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在基层党建组织力提升、落实党管人才、教师培养发展、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提升教育业绩、</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">担当作为深化服务群众等方面，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">离我们一中的社会定位、家长满意度</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">还存在</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一定</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">差距。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">习总书记说</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：“学习的最大敌人是自我满足，要学有所成，就必须永不自满。”</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于不忘初心、牢记使命的重要论述精神，以这次主题教育为新的起点，牢牢把握新时代全面从严治党的基本规律，总结好、运用好、巩固好主题教育成果，继续回答好“不忘初心、牢记使命”这个党的建设永恒课题和党员干部终身课题，持续推动守初心、不停步、再出发。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为了今后把永恒课题、终身课题回答好，我们还要持续</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">念好“六字真经”</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一要抓牢“领”字，突出示范性。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委带头做好支部书记的引领工作，支部书记带头做好党员引领工作，全体党员教师“亮身份、亮承诺、见行动”，在业务带头、思想引领、品行示范等方面锤炼打造党员先锋队</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">树立标杆当表率，从思想到行动再到业绩，真正体现党组织先进性、党员示范性。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二要把稳“广”字，突出全覆盖。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">确保工作推进不留死角、不留空白，确保每一位党员教师在党小组、支部和党委活动中认真参与</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，经受锻炼，获得提升</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委的目光要</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">延伸到离退休</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">支部</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在校学生课余党</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">团</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，切实做好思想引领组织关怀，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">凝聚共识激励行动。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三要紧扣“深”字，突出剖根源。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">始终</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">把握</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">好</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党的群众路线，发扬深入群众、依靠群众的优良传统，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委班子要在学习、调研、实践中锻炼“火眼金睛”</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，透过现象看本质，把问题分析深、分析透。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">积极发扬党内批评与自我批评的优良作风</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">树牢</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">刀刃向内自我革命</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的勇气，推进各项工作</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四要聚焦“实”字，突出求实效。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学习要能看到真真切切提高思想认识、理论水平的实效；排查检视要紧扣师生群众的实际困难</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，聚焦</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党员组织的自身实际问题；整改落实一切以问题解决不解决、师生群众满不满意为标准</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，在学校各项工作中努力</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提振师生凝聚力与向心力、家长获得感与满意度。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五要着眼“恒”字，突出持续改。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">把学懂弄通习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想放在首位，并以此长期引领整改工作；</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要把“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育作为学校政治建设的长期任务，并鲜明地体现在学校教学管理、教师队伍建设和学科发展建设上。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">六要注重“融”字，突出两结合。</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“党建”与“业务”融合，防止“两张皮”，做好“双带头”。引领广大教师把政治学习与业务成长有机结合，增强党建意识，锤炼工作作风，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自觉</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">把精湛的</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学技能、精深的科研</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">能力</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、高超的育人方法，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">融入到</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">惠民解难题，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为家长学生办实事好事</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的具体行动中去。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同志们，</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">今天的总结只是阶段性工作的回顾，更是</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">再出发</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的新起点</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。我们</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一定</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要</span><span style="color: black;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">把主题教育焕发的政治热情转化为攻坚克难、干事创业的强大动力，牢记初心使命、坚持立德树人，以新担当新作为，奋力争当绍兴教育排头兵；用新业绩新气象，全力开创绍兴一中高水平发展的新局面！</span></p>
    
